From 1e07ebcbe14a4483c3d23df966c14dcfe6766b27 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: PromethenDev <PromethenDev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 00:02:03 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 119/149] xthread: reclaim guest stacks of fully finished
 threads (cvar WWE2K14_THREAD_FREE_STACK_ON_EXIT, default off)

WWE 2K14 #5/#19/#29: repeated created-superstar saves ran out of guest stack space (C0000017).
On Windows ExitThread skips XThread's self reference, so exited threads never freed their stacks.
Externally cancelled threads are quarantined. Host test: thread_stack_reclamation_driver.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
